  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CrystalBallDialogue
  itemId: CatItem
  dependencies: []
  prePickupDialogue: I saw something in the crystal ball.... I can't see it clearly....
    seems like a paw
  lockedDialogue: The mist inside won't clear... I feel like I'm missing something
    important.
  postPickupDialogues:
  - I remember, I remember I was a cat,
  - I was jumping around the village rooftops, chasing shadows and sunlight.
  - The world was so much bigger from up there.
